From 9fb8048447d7d0de45c1539ea2e611b8d38064fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?J=C3=BCrgen=20Schmied?= <juergenschmied70@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 13:08:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] [Quantization] Dispatch FP8_PER_CHANNEL_PER_TOKEN in
 MIXED_PRECISION
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

ModelOptFp8PcPtLinearMethod is defined but unreachable through
ModelOptMixedPrecisionConfig.get_quant_method: the algo resolves from
quantized_layers, matches no branch, and falls through to
UnquantizedLinearMethod. The layer then never registers weight_scale and
the checkpoint fails to load with 'no module or parameter named
...weight_scale'.

This matters for shapes that blockwise FP8 cannot take. FP8_PB_WO needs
both dims divisible by 128; Qwen3.8-Flash-Next hyper-connections are
(320, 10240), (10240, 320) and (4, 10240), so out%128 is 64 or 4 and
in%128 is 64 -- every one falls off the fast CUTLASS blockwise kernel.
Per-output-channel scales carry no block constraint and also slice
cleanly across a fused MergedColumnParallelLinear, which a blockwise
scale cannot when one shard is 4 wide.

Signed-off-by: Jürgen Schmied <juergenschmied70@gmail.com>
---
 vllm/model_executor/layers/quantization/modelopt.py | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/vllm/model_executor/layers/quantization/modelopt.py b/vllm/model_executor/layers/quantization/modelopt.py
index 241a7c8ad..307a337c4 100644
--- a/vllm/model_executor/layers/quantization/modelopt.py
+++ b/vllm/model_executor/layers/quantization/modelopt.py
@@ -2418,6 +2418,8 @@ class ModelOptMixedPrecisionConfig(ModelOptQuantConfigBase):
                 return ModelOptNvFp4W4A16LinearMethod(self.w4a16_nvfp4_config)
             if quant_algo == "MXFP8":
                 return ModelOptMxFp8LinearMethod(self.mxfp8_config)
+            if quant_algo == "FP8_PER_CHANNEL_PER_TOKEN":
+                return ModelOptFp8PcPtLinearMethod(self.fp8_config)
             # Layer not in quantized_layers — leave unquantized
             return UnquantizedLinearMethod()
 
